      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Forest City Enterprises and Brookfield Properties led the master plan that turned the former airport into a pedestrian‑oriented urbanist project.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
