      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Central Park borders the restored Sand Creek Regional Greenway and Bluff Lake Nature Center, one of the nation’s largest urban wildlife refuges.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
